---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const process = [
  {
    title: "Theater onboarding & setup",
    body: "Theater partners submit venue details, dead-time windows, ticket pricing, and payout setup so each campaign can run on theater-approved terms.",
  },
  {
    title: "Campaign launch with 3 ranked films",
    body: "Fans submit a themed campaign with exactly three ranked movie choices. Campaigns open with Rights Pending and move forward only as demand proves out.",
  },
  {
    title: "Dual-threshold demand validation",
    body: "Each campaign tracks both committed backers and broader watch interest. At ~70% progress, theaters receive an automated licensing-check request.",
  },
  {
    title: "Confirmation, screening, reconciliation",
    body: "Once rights and thresholds are met, the theater confirms scheduling. After showtime, ticket proceeds are reconciled with the agreed 75/25 net-profit split.",
  },
];
---

<Layout title="For theaters" description="How ReelVotes partners with independent theaters to program movie nights with validated demand.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <span class="mx-auto block w-fit rounded-full border border-line bg-paper px-4 py-1.5 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-soft">
      For theaters
    </span>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-center font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-5xl">
      How ReelVotes works with your theater
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-center text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      We run a structured process designed to reduce risk and ensure demand before a screening is scheduled.
      If a qualified screening underperforms, ReelVotes covers the downside.
    </p>

    <ol class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
      {process.map((item, index) => (
        <li
          class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-marquee/25 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_-12px_rgba(48,59,107,0.18)]"
          data-reveal
          style={`transition-delay: ${index * 90}ms`}
        >
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-marquee-soft font-display text-sm font-semibold text-marquee">
            {index + 1}
          </span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">{item.body}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-cream-soft p-6">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Marketing responsibilities</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>We run campaign discovery and drive local audience participation.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>We help push campaigns from interest to committed backing.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Your theater keeps normal control of local promotion and final schedule decisions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-cream-soft p-6">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">How selections are determined</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Each campaign includes exactly 3 ranked movie choices.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Rights checks trigger after demand reaches threshold milestones.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Studios/distributors are checked in priority order (Choice 1, 2, then 3).</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>If no title clears, campaign closes with no customer charge capture.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="submit" class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Control & approvals</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Your theater retains full control over:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Which films are eligible for screening.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Final rights confirmation and go/no-go decisions.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>What dates and dead-time windows screenings occur.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-marquee">&#8226;</span>Ticket pricing and in-venue operations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-faint">Revenue model: 75% theater / 25% ReelVotes net profit split after licensing fee, with theater keeping 100% concession revenue.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-gold/35 bg-paper p-8 text-center shadow-[0_0_40px_-12px_rgba(255,207,107,0.25)]" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Ready to partner with ReelVotes?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Submit your theater details, dead times, and pricing through our partner onboarding form.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/theater-registration"
        class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-marquee px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-marquee/30 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        Submit your theater
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
